1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:05,240
Wait a minute, Farmanfarmian is speaking
and you're bogarting the symposium?

2
00:00:05,453 --> 00:00:08,913
- Howard, I'm sorry, we would've...
- No, no, you're quark-blocking us.

3
00:00:11,209 --> 00:00:13,419
(Leonard:)I don't know what to say.

4
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:14,960
(Leonard(opening door):)Wow.

5
00:00:15,129 --> 00:00:17,089
- Howard...
- It's your Millennium Falcon...

6
00:00:17,256 --> 00:00:20,096
(Howard:)...you and Chewbacca do
whatever you wanna do.

7
00:00:21,427 --> 00:00:24,927
(Howard:)Me and Princess Leia here will find
some other way to spend the evening.

8
00:00:25,098 --> 00:00:26,768
(Penny:)Howard, wait.

9
00:00:26,933 --> 00:00:29,973
(Penny:)Sheldon, I think we should tell them.

10
00:00:31,145 --> 00:00:32,475
(Sheldon:)Okay, sure.

11
00:00:32,647 --> 00:00:34,227
(Sheldon:)I don't see a problem with that.

12
00:00:35,566 --> 00:00:37,566
(Penny:)There's no symposium.

13
00:00:37,735 --> 00:00:39,825
(Penny:)Leonard lied to me.
Isn't that right, Leonard?

14
00:00:39,987 --> 00:00:41,487
(Penny:)Well...

15
00:00:42,198 --> 00:00:45,658
(Leonard:)- I don't know what to say.
- It's okay, I do.

16
00:00:45,827 --> 00:00:48,457
(Penny:)Look, Leonard is helping Sheldon
through a family crisis.

17
00:00:48,621 --> 00:00:53,291
(Penny:)He made up the whole story about
the symposium with Dr. Farmanfarmian...

18
00:00:53,459 --> 00:00:54,499
- Good for you.
- Ha! Yeah.

19
00:00:56,212 --> 00:01:00,092
(Penny:)He didn't want Sheldon to be embarrassed.
There's nothing to be embarrassed about.

